https://github.com/tessera-io/platform/pull/371

Streams the export instead of building the whole file in memory. 200k-row plants go from timeout to ~40s locally. Chunk size 5k rows, gzip on the wire.

Things I want eyes on:
- the encoding path (we now write bytes directly, not through the old csv writer)
- cancellation when the client disconnects mid-stream
- the test for the last partial chunk

Not touching the filter code, that's a separate PR. Review by tomorrow would be great 🙏

